t 1 Child (Name Unknown)\n\n- With Nicole Carter: At Least 1 Child (Name Unknown)\n\n- 5 Baby Mothers: 6 Children (Names Unknown)\n\nJason Caffey, who is 50 years old, is most known for his supporting role on the Chicago Bulls championship teams in"
