wer for Top journals in Industry, Chemical Engineering, and Environmental Chemistry.\n\nResearch Intrest:\n\nResearch Interest: Nutrition, Industrial Chemistry, Analytical Chemistry, Environmental Chemical Engineering, Environmental Science, Environmental Chemistry, Green Chemistry, Cement Industry, Ceramics, Paper Industry, Advances in Cleaner Production, Climate Change, Pollution, Wastewater Treatment, Air Pollution, Eco-friendly Biopolymers, Persistent Organic Pollutants,"
