and Curriculum Development. She joined APC in June 2008.\n\nPaul EmmanuelAssociate Pastor (East) & Life Group Coordinator\n\nPaul EmmanuelAssociate Pastor (East) & Life Group Coordinator\n\nPaul has a Bachelor of Commerce degree from Bangalore University. He has 5 years of experience in the corporate sector. Paul has completed his Bachelors in Theology and Christian Ministry from APC Bible College. Paul has been serving with APC full-time since"
